test('narrow320/390 cameras frame unscaled real bounds across front back sides top bottom and rolls',()=>{const a=build(T);for(const width of[300,370])for(let yaw=-180;yaw<=180;yaw+=30)for(const pitch of[-80,12,88]){const r=fitView(T,a.bounds,{yaw,pitch,roll:yaw/3,distance:1},width/350);assert.ok(Object.values(r.ndcBounds).every(v=>Number.isFinite(v)&&Math.abs(v)<.87));}assert.deepEqual(a.group.scale.toArray(),[1,1,1]);a.dispose();});
